== Introduction
<introduction>
Building on the previous class (the #strong[status] of Ramī ---
#strong[wājib] in the Ḥanafī school, with its dalīl: #strong[ijmāʿ], the
Prophet's ﷺ #strong[order], and his #strong[action] --- his action
